  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center of the Immaculate Heart of Mary in Uganda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Centrum Nepo&#x161;kvrnen&#xe9;ho srdca Panny M&#xe1;rie v Ugande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for children with HIV / AIDS in the village of Unna in the north of Uganda was opened in December 2012. Its purpose is to provide sick, abandoned and neglected orphans the opportunity to improve their basic living conditions, provide necessary medical care, access to education and thus a decent future. Related Project is the distance adoption - financial assistance for children from the poorest families with a view to their integration into schools.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Centrum pre deti s HIV/AIDS v dedine Unna na severe Ugandy bolo otvoren&#xe9; v decembri 2012. Jeho &#xfa;&#x10d;elom je poskytn&#xfa;t chor&#xfd;m, opusten&#xfd;m a zanedb&#xe1;van&#xfd;ch sirot&#xe1;m pr&#xed;le&#x17e;itos&#x165; zlep&#x161;i&#x165; ich z&#xe1;kladn&#xe9; &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9; podmienky, zabezpe&#x10d;i&#x165; potrebn&#xfa; zdravotn&#xfa; starostlivos&#x165;, pr&#xed;stup k vzdelaniu a t&#xfd;m d&#xf4;stojn&#xfa; bud&#xfa;cnos&#x165;. S&#xfa;visiacom projektom je adopcia na dia&#x13e;ku - finan&#x10d;n&#xe1; asistencia pre deti z najchudobnej&#x161;&#xed;ch rod&#xed;n s cie&#x13e;om ich integr&#xe1;cie do &#x161;k&#xf4;l. Pom&#xe1;ha sa rodi&#x10d;om/z&#xe1;stupcom die&#x165;a&#x165;a preklen&#xfa;&#x165; finan&#x10d;n&#xe9; obmedzenia, ktor&#xe9; br&#xe1;nia de&#x165;om zap&#xed;sa&#x165; sa do &#x161;k&#xf4;l a z&#xed;ska&#x165; revelentn&#xe9; vzdelanie.</narrative>
  </description>
